{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226934","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226934","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422693401:0":{"text":"呵……你……你们，尤其是你，因度厄……","source_cn":"呵……你……你们，尤其是你，因度厄……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF00A8775C972639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422693402:0":{"text":"你又要凭着自己天真的妄想，毁掉整个族群的未来了吗……","source_cn":"你又要凭着自己天真的妄想，毁掉整个族群的未来了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03B6DA5A3EAB433A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422693403:0":{"text":"像你这样继续肆意散播灵露，才是真正毁掉萨洛克兰的行径！","source_cn":"像你这样继续肆意散播灵露，才是真正毁掉萨洛克兰的行径！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DB914E3994A56B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422693404:0":{"text":"想毁掉这里的明明是你！","source_cn":"想毁掉这里的明明是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E9BFAC908579505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422693405:0":{"text":"因度厄，你根本不知道我们背负着多么沉重的过去，只是遇到了幸运的魔法师帮你解决了难题。","source_cn":"因度厄，你根本不知道我们背负着多么沉重的过去，只是遇到...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84209C422828BEA8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"因度厄，你根本不知道我们背负着多么沉重的过去，只是遇到了幸运的魔法师帮你解决了难题。","female":"因度厄，你根本不知道我们背负着多么沉重的过去，只是遇到了幸运的魔法师帮你解决了难题。","variant_male_record_index":"16